      "statement": "Each Session owns an id naming its artifact folder, a subject, its own ObjectStore, its simulation Run records (capped at MAX_RUNS), an in-flight call counter, its last-use time and a worker-pool share, held in a _Session dataclass; a Run record holds its result's object_ref while the result itself lives in the Session's ObjectStore.",
